---
source: src/tui/view.rs
expression: "rows.join(\"\\n\")"
---
 ?┌LEGEND───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐:56
┌S│ ↑               served on a newer model: bright on the latest turn, dim earlier             │──┐
│s│ $               released past the armed quota gate for this window                          │le│
│s│ %               released to the end of the plan, stopping before overage                    │1m│
│s│ !               stopped: the last thing this session got was a gate notice                  │1m│
│…│ ✗               failed: this session's newest finished request ended in failure             │  │
└─│ ~               routed to this model, none served yet                                       │──┘
┌C│ ↺               compactions so far; - for none                                              │──┐
│s│ -               not reported, which is not zero                                             │  │
│s│ ?               unknown: model, context ceiling, or token count                             │  │
│…│ ≥               a floor: some rows unknown, or the span predates the data                   │  │
└─│ <1%             spent less than the meter's 1% step shows; 0% is none at all                │──┘
┌T│ ·               no requests in that slice of the window; red holds an error                 │──┐
│f│ ‹N              N accounts hidden to the left of the meters shown                           │  │
│c│ … N more        N accounts hidden to the right                                              │  │
│c│ on track        the meter resets before it runs out                                         │  │
│c│ estimating      too little data to separate burn from noise                                 │  │
│o│ stops ~T        reaches the armed gate's threshold at T                                     │  │
│h│ out ~T          runs out at T                                                               │  │
│m│ gated ·         past the gate; the countdown is to exhaustion                               │  │
└─│ on track?       a trailing ?: the gate's state is assumed, not observed                     │──┘
┌C│ last req        green under 30s, yellow under 5m, red beyond                                │──┐
│2│ ctx             green: native 1M; yellow: another known ceiling                             │  │
│s│ idle            dim once a session has been quiet 3m                                        │  │
│n│ held sent recv  in flight: not yet sent, awaiting a reply, or streaming; timed from arrival │  │
│·│ +N              N more requests in flight in that session                                   │  │
└─│ KEYS                                                                                        │──┘
┌R│ click           open a session's detail                                                     │──┐
│ │ … 4 more                                                                                    │  │
└─└? or esc close───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘──┘
